29/06/99

   o zmf.library/FileControl/fb#?.library/filebase.library/etc. - Phew!
       Mostly finished a fairly big overhaul of the File system,
       which is what I've been doing for the past three days or
       so... It now uses filebase libraries in exactly the same way
       as the Message system uses message base libraries. In light
       of this, libs:filebase.library can be deleted as it's now
       implemented via fbzeus.library. Also the file & multipath
       areas data files have changed format - a program is supplied
       ("Zeus1.1->1.2") to update these. You *must* run the Zeus
       1.2 file config/manager/sig programs with this data file,
       keeping the 1.1 programs will cause Bad Things to happen.
       NB: only the fbzeus.library is supplied, and *no* programming
       docs are provided yet.  More filebase libraries will follow from
       us, another one is actually finished but there are some problems
       to fix first.
   o zmf.library - AreasLoad() no longer requires filebase list in A1 :)
